  "limitations": [
    "Class model + source-extracted expressions, not a runtime import; torch/pool objects are modelled.",
    "is_hybrid_swa for Spark-X2.6-1.7B is prior evidence (21/28 sliding layers, window 511), not re-derived here; if the model had no sliding_window_size the block would never be reached.",
    "Prefill-forward counts are bounds (token budget vs worst packing); decode-forward counts assume batch == concurrency and are lower bounds on forwards only if batch < concurrency.",
    "No GPU/CUDA/page/overlap behaviour is executed; no perf claim."
